{
  "id": "equivalence-proportion-one",
  "name": {
    "de": "Äquivalenztest für einen Anteil (TOST)",
    "en": "Equivalence Test for One Proportion (TOST)"
  },
  "category": "attribute",
  "subcategory": "equivalence",
  "status": "validated",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": {
    "short": {
      "de": "Prüft, ob ein Anteil x/n innerhalb der Äquivalenzgrenzen um p₀ liegt – zwei exakte einseitige Binomialtests (TOST).",
      "en": "Tests whether a proportion x/n lies within the equivalence limits around p₀ – two exact one-sided binomial tests (TOST)."
    },
    "long": {
      "de": "Grenzen sind Differenzen zu p₀ (untere < 0 < obere). Untere Nullhypothese p ≤ p₀ + untere Grenze: p = P(X ≥ x | p₀ + untere Grenze); obere Nullhypothese p ≥ p₀ + obere Grenze: p = P(X ≤ x | p₀ + obere Grenze). Liegt eine Grenze bei oder jenseits von 0 bzw. 1, ist der zugehörige p-Wert 0. Gesamt-p = Maximum beider; gleichwertig bei p < α. Das Konfidenzintervall (Clopper-Pearson) hat das Niveau 1 − 2α. Referenz: statsmodels binom_tost; Minitab bietet Äquivalenztests nur für Mittelwerte.",
      "en": "Limits are differences from p₀ (lower < 0 < upper). Lower null hypothesis p ≤ p₀ + lower limit: p = P(X ≥ x | p₀ + lower limit); upper null hypothesis p ≥ p₀ + upper limit: p = P(X ≤ x | p₀ + upper limit). A limit at or beyond 0 or 1 gives a p-value of 0. Overall p = the larger of both; equivalent if p < α. The (Clopper-Pearson) confidence interval has level 1 − 2α. Reference: statsmodels binom_tost; Minitab offers equivalence tests for means only."
    }
  },
  "documentation": {
    "formulas": [
      {
        "label": "p lower",
        "latex": "p_L = P(X \\ge x \\mid p_0 + \\delta_L),\\; X\\sim\\mathrm{Bin}(n, \\cdot)",
        "description": {
          "de": "Untere einseitige Prüfung",
          "en": "Lower one-sided test"
        }
      },
      {
        "label": "p upper",
        "latex": "p_U = P(X \\le x \\mid p_0 + \\delta_U)",
        "description": {
          "de": "Obere einseitige Prüfung",
          "en": "Upper one-sided test"
        }
      },
      {
        "label": "p",
        "latex": "p = \\max(p_L, p_U)",
        "description": {
          "de": "Gleichwertig bei p < α",
          "en": "Equivalent if p < α"
        }
      }
    ],
    "assumptions": [
      {
        "de": "Unabhängige Bernoulli-Versuche mit konstanter Wahrscheinlichkeit",
        "en": "Independent Bernoulli trials with constant probability"
      }
    ],
    "limitations": [
      {
        "de": "Äquivalenzgrenzen gelten als Differenz; nur ein bestandener TOST belegt Gleichwertigkeit, ein nicht bestandener belegt sie nicht.",
        "en": "Equivalence limits are differences; only a passed TOST shows equivalence, a failed one does not."
      },
      {
        "de": "Minitab bietet Äquivalenztests nur für Mittelwerte; Referenz statsmodels",
        "en": "Minitab offers equivalence tests for means only; reference is statsmodels"
      }
    ],
    "references": [
      {
        "source": "statsmodels 0.14.6: statsmodels.stats.proportion.binom_tost"
      }
    ],
    "minitab_equivalent": null
  },
  "source": {
    "function_name": "equivalenceOneProportion",
    "file_path": "js/engines/attribute-test-engine.js",
    "signature": {
      "parameters": [
        {
          "name": "x",
          "type": "number",
          "required": true,
          "description": {
            "de": "Anzahl Ereignisse",
            "en": "Number of events"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "n",
          "type": "number",
          "required": true,
          "description": {
            "de": "Anzahl Versuche",
            "en": "Number of trials"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "p0",
          "type": "number",
          "required": true,
          "description": {
            "de": "Referenzanteil p₀",
            "en": "Reference proportion p₀"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "lower",
          "type": "number",
          "required": true,
          "description": {
            "de": "Untere Grenze als Differenz zu p₀ (negativ)",
            "en": "Lower limit as a difference from p₀ (negative)"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "upper",
          "type": "number",
          "required": true,
          "description": {
            "de": "Obere Grenze als Differenz zu p₀ (positiv)",
            "en": "Upper limit as a difference from p₀ (positive)"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "alpha",
          "type": "number",
          "required": false,
          "description": {
            "de": "Signifikanzniveau (Standard 0.05)",
            "en": "Significance level (default 0.05)"
          }
        }
      ],
      "returns": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "pHat": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": {
              "de": "Anteil x/n",
              "en": "Proportion x/n"
            }
          },
          "pValue": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": {
              "de": "p-Wert (Maximum beider Tests)",
              "en": "p-value (larger of both tests)"
            }
          },
          "equivalent": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": {
              "de": "Gleichwertig?",
              "en": "Equivalent?"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "code_snippet": null
  },
